<title>Использование нескольких списков задач или заметок</title>

<p>You can have multiple task or memo lists and choose which of your lists get displayed. For example, you might have tasks for work, tasks for home, and tasks for the singing club of which you are a member. The sidebar shows these lists, and you can select or deselect any of the boxes next to them to show and hide the corresponding tasks or memos in your view.</p>

<p>Tasks and memos from each task or memo list appear in a different color.</p>

<p>Также можно использовать списки, которые находятся не на компьютере, а в Интернете.</p>
<p>New tasks are created in the selected task list in the Tasks window. If no list is selected, new tasks are created in the default task list. Likewise for memos.</p>
